@BookTracker.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5125



### Get Books
GET http://localhost:5125/books

### Get Books Page 1
GET http://localhost:5125/books?page=1&pageSize=10

### Get Books Page 2
GET http://localhost:5125/books?page=2&pageSize=10

### Search Books
GET http://localhost:5125/books?search=octopus

### Search Books With Paging
GET http://localhost:5125/books?search=octopus&page=1&pageSize=5

### Create Book
POST http://localhost:5125/books
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..7o6nWScNrl__4Zq1WKVRaoZPLKN9IKKEssVPv5-ings

{
  "title": "Dune",
  "author": "Frank Herbert",
  "year": 1965
}

### Delete Book
DELETE http://localhost:5125/books/1

### Update Book
PUT http://localhost:5125/books/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..jbnGQ5bf9iHO_ByTs5YlI_DnoEGBmNtbYDs6_0uSvIw

{
  "title": "Changes 2",
  "author": "David Bowieeeee",
  "year": 1972,
  "version": "bc5c33ce-803f-4e86-b20e-52a7dc887adb"
}

### Get Book by Id
GET http://localhost:5125/books/1

### Get Members
GET http://localhost:5125/members

### Create Member With Credentials
POST http://localhost:5125/members
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ada Lovelace",
  "email": "ada@example.com",
  "password": "analytical-engine"
}

